= Mercurial XXX =

== New Features ==

* automated setup of shell compression through the `hg admin::setup-shell-completion` command.
* status: added support for `--from` and `--to` options.
* paths: add a `remote-cmd` suboption for ssh allowing to define the remote
  command for each named path.
* exchange: rename the `ui.remotecmd` config and `--remotecmd` command flag to
  `ui.remote-cmd` and `--remote-cmd` (with backward compatibility.
* bundlespec: the case of a parameter name now says whether it is mandatory. See
  `hg help bundlespec`.

