== New Experimental Features ==

== Deprecations ==

* The `treemanifest` format is deprecated and will no longer be supported in a
  future version. See `hg help internals.requirements.treemanifest` for
  instructions on how to convert a repository to migrate away from it.

== Bug Fixes ==

== Backwards Compatibility Changes ==

* clonebundles: the server now honors the `store_fingerprint` argument of the
  `clonebundles_manifest` command, which it previously accepted and ignored.
  Clients from 6.5 to 7.1 do not send that argument and are no longer offered
  clone bundles that cover only part of the store since they would not
  understand that it is a partial clone. Clients from 7.2 on send the argument
  and are unaffected.

== Internal API Changes ==

* Extensions adding bundlespec parameters must extend
  `mercurial.bundlecaches.KNOWN_BUNDLE_SPEC_PARAMS` and, if applicable,
  `MANDATORY_BUNDLE_SPEC_PARAMS`.

== Miscellaneous ==

* The `--command` flag of the `hg debugshell` now accepts a multi-line script
  and no longer implicitly print the command result.
